","new":"def _numbers(ev, bindings, expected, numerical_payloads=None):
    """Separate payload digests, never one combined document.

    reference_sha256 is SHA-256 of a JSON array of reference numbers.
    array_sha256 is SHA-256 of a JSON object
    {"encoding":"target"|"delta","values":[...]}:
    target values are actual outputs; delta values are actual minus reference.
    Both byte digests are checked before parsing. A missing payload is NOT_CHECKED.
    Limit per element is atol + rtol * abs(reference), with atol/rtol at or under
    the predeclared pair. RMSE is over those signed errors and must be <= max abs.
